# Nursery Management System — Full End-to-End Test Plan

## 1. Test Objective

Validate that the Nursery Management System supports the complete operational lifecycle of a nursery branch without data gaps, duplicate functionality, incorrect permissions, stale data, duplicate network calls, broken integrations, or inconsistent KPI reporting.

The primary business flow under test is:

**Create Harrow branch → configure branch details → add staff → assign managers and roles → receive enquiry → deputy manager handles enquiry → book visit → complete visit → convert enquiry to registration → assign child to room → assign staff to room → record child and staff attendance → add daily logs → verify dashboards, KPIs, APIs, notifications, audit records, and database consistency.**

