# 12. Duplicate Functionality Review

Review the codebase and UI for overlapping features such as:

* Two enquiry creation services
* Separate visit booking modules performing the same operation
* Child registration implemented in multiple components
* Staff attendance and payroll hours calculated independently
* Room assignment stored in both child and room records without a single source of truth
* KPI logic duplicated between frontend and backend
* Notification logic triggered from both controller and event listener
* Multiple repositories writing to the same table
* Legacy and new APIs active simultaneously
* Duplicate route handlers
* Duplicate event consumers
* Multiple forms for the same business action
* Separate status enumerations with inconsistent values

## Expected architecture principle

Each business capability should have:

* One authoritative service
* One source of truth
* One documented API contract
* One status model
* One consistent validation layer
* One audit mechanism
* One event publication path

The frontend may present multiple views, but all views should use the same backend business operation.

